WEBVTT

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:30.153
And it's only by stepping back,
and then further back,

00:14:30.153 --> 00:14:31.891
and holding still,

00:14:31.891 --> 00:14:34.709
that we can begin to see
what the canvas means

00:14:34.709 --> 00:14:37.005
and to catch the larger picture.

00:14:37.005 --> 00:14:40.990
And a few people do that for us
by going nowhere.

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:43.972
So, in an age of acceleration,

00:14:43.972 --> 00:14:48.021
nothing can be more exhilarating
than going slow.

00:14:48.021 --> 00:14:50.202
And in an age of distraction,

00:14:50.202 --> 00:14:53.865
nothing is so luxurious
as paying attention.

00:14:54.715 --> 00:14:57.441
And in an age of constant movement,

00:14:57.441 --> 00:15:01.214
nothing is so urgent as sitting still.